{"id":"84538a9442ddea2d","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points.md","title":"Boundaries of the Modalization Hypothesis","display":"prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points — Boundaries of the Modalization Hypothesis","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points","aliases":["89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points — Boundaries of the Modalization Hypothesis","depends_on":["[[89-df-fixed-point]]","[[89-thm-gl-consistency]]","[[89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl]]","[[89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality]]","[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","[[89-df-lob-axiom]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points — Boundaries of the Modalization Hypothesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"12a315bba5062a88\" href=\"?note=12a315bba5062a88\" title=\"89-thm-gl-consistency\">89-thm-gl-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fae50ce87c0c5e77\" href=\"?note=fae50ce87c0c5e77\" title=\"89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl\">89-thm-substitution-lemma-gl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ad8a244f68941668\" href=\"?note=ad8a244f68941668\" title=\"89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality\">89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"491579297d817026\" href=\"?note=491579297d817026\" title=\"89-df-lob-axiom\">89-df-lob-axiom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}},\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}},\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}},\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}},\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为弱、加强和原书不动点谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}\\)</span> 为模态化谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是字母集。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}nonmodalized\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}points}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\to\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(p,p,H)),\\\\\n&amp;\\neg\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(p,p,H),\\\\\n&amp;\\neg\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\neg p,p,H),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(p\\lor\\Box p,p,\\top),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(\\mathrm{Modalized}(B,p)\\to((p\\lor\\Box p)\\leftrightarrow B)\\notin\\mathrm{GL}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}nonmodalized\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}points}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\to\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(p,p,H)),\\\\\n&amp;\\neg\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathrm{BFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(p,p,H),\\\\\n&amp;\\neg\\exists H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\\mathrm{Fix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(\\neg p,p,H),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(p\\lor\\Box p,p,\\top),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(\\mathrm{Modalized}(B,p)\\to((p\\lor\\Box p)\\leftrightarrow B)\\notin\\mathrm{GL}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 104（模态化条件与加强定义；本库反例）；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>第一式仅需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\leftrightarrow H\">\\(H\\leftrightarrow H\\)</span>。若第二式的加强候选存在，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow p)\">\\(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow p)\\)</span> 是定理，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leftrightarrow H\">\\(p\\leftrightarrow H\\)</span> 可证；分别替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:=\\top\">\\(p:=\\top\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:=\\bot\">\\(p:=\\bot\\)</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,\\neg H\">\\(H,\\neg H\\)</span> 可证，违反 GL 一致性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\leftrightarrow\\neg H\">\\(H\\leftrightarrow\\neg H\\)</span> 同样违反一致性，给第三式。\n第四式令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=(\\Box p\\to p)\">\\(E=(\\Box p\\to p)\\)</span>。方程 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leftrightarrow(p\\lor\\Box p)\">\\(p\\leftrightarrow(p\\lor\\Box p)\\)</span> 命题等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+E\">\\(\\Box^+E\\)</span> 由 Löb 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span>，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，所以推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+p\">\\(\\Box^+p\\)</span>。反向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box p\">\\(\\Box p\\)</span> 经必然化的命题蕴含给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box E\">\\(\\Box E\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+p\\to\\Box^+E\">\\(\\Box^+p\\to\\Box^+E\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow\\top)\">\\(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow\\top)\\)</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+p\">\\(\\Box^+p\\)</span>，即得加强条件和空字母界。\n最后若它等价于模态化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\to B\">\\(p\\to B\\)</span> 可证。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 有有限 GL 反模型，改根 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为真会保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 假，违反该定理；所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 是定理，从等价得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\lor\\Box p\">\\(p\\lor\\Box p\\)</span> 可证。替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:=\\bot\">\\(p:=\\bot\\)</span> 将推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\Box\\bot\\)</span> 可证，但二点严格链根反驳它，矛盾。模态化是原书统一存在唯一性定理的充分条件；某些未模态化公式仍有加强不动点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"12a315bba5